    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112318" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρῑκ-ᾰλέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shivering with cold,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				16
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), <i>Cat. Cod.Astr.</i><i><span class="en">
				2.165
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>dreadful, horrid,</i>
